{
  "declaredLength": 11120,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hay que tener un rival en esta vida!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006100790020007100750065002000740065006E0065007200200075006E00200072006900760061006C00200065006E0020006500730074006100200076006900640061002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Estoy de acuerdo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004500730074006F00790020006400650020006100630075006500720064006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Estás seguro?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00450073007400E10073002000730065006700750072006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿A que sí?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF004100200071007500650020007300ED003F002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Claro que sí!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006C00610072006F00200071007500650020007300ED002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y quiero que tú seas mi rival!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059002000710075006900650072006F00200071007500650020007400FA002000730065006100730020006D006900200072006900760061006C002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entiendo que te confunda la propuesta, ¡pero\ndeja que te lo explique con una historia!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Érase una vez dos Entrenadores nacidos el mismo\ndía que criaron a sendos Charcadet.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Charcadet puede evolucionar a dos Pokémon\ndistintos según el objeto que se use.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero no puede ser eternamente un Charcadet,\ndel mismo modo que dos rivales no pueden<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nseguir por siempre un mismo camino.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tras separarse, ¡uno de ellos haría evolucionar\nal suyo a Armarouge y, el otro, a Ceruledge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hasta que, un buen día, ambos Entrenadores\n(que somos tú y yo, por si no te quedaba claro)...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se reencontraron dispuestos a librar un duelo\nfinal para decidir quién era más fuerte:<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Armarouge o Ceruledge, la luz o la oscuridad,\nel bien o el mal, las churras o las merinas!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 186
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Apasionante, ¿verdad? Es lo que siempre he\nsoñado, pero no tengo ningún amigo que naciera<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nel mismo día que yo, y mucho menos un rival.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n¡Por eso quiero que lo seas tú!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 177
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te lo pondré fácil! Para hacer que Charcadet\nevolucione necesitas una Armadura Auspiciosa o<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nuna Armadura Maldita.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Elige una y te la daré! ¡Haz evolucionar a\nCharcadet y bríndame el combate de mis sueños!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cuando hayas decidido qué armadura quieres,\ndímelo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004300750061006E0064006F00200068006100790061007300200064006500630069006400690064006F00200071007500E9002000610072006D0061006400750072006100200071007500690065007200650073002C000A006400ED006D0065006C006F002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Ya has decidido qué armadura quieres?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00590061002000680061007300200064006500630069006400690064006F00200071007500E9002000610072006D0061006400750072006100200071007500690065007200650073003F00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La Armadura Auspiciosa",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000410072006D0061006400750072006100200041007500730070006900630069006F007300610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La Armadura Maldita",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000410072006D006100640075007200610020004D0061006C00640069007400610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aún no me decido",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100FA006E0020006E006F0020006D0065002000640065006300690064006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Quiero librar el duelo de mis sueños contra ti!\n¡No decidas a la ligera!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que la Armadura Auspiciosa... Quieres que\ntu Charcadet evolucione a Armarouge.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En tal caso, yo usaré la Armadura Maldita y haré\nque el mío lo haga a Ceruledge.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Adelante, Charcadet! ¡Tuyo es el poder de la\nllama azul!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100640065006C0061006E00740065002C00200043006800610072006300610064006500740021002000A1005400750079006F00200065007300200065006C00200070006F0064006500720020006400650020006C0061000A006C006C0061006D006100200061007A0075006C002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Será un duelo entre tu Armarouge y mi\nCeruledge! ¡Ningún otro Pokémon vale!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Leeedge!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004C00650065006500640067006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que la Armadura Maldita... Quieres que tu\nCharcadet evolucione a Ceruledge.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En tal caso, yo usaré la Armadura Auspiciosa y\nharé que el mío lo haga a Armarouge.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Adelante, Charcadet! ¡Tuyo es el poder de la\nllama carmesí!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100640065006C0061006E00740065002C00200043006800610072006300610064006500740021002000A1005400750079006F00200065007300200065006C00200070006F0064006500720020006400650020006C0061000A006C006C0061006D00610020006300610072006D0065007300ED002100100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Será un duelo entre tu Ceruledge y mi\nArmarouge! ¡Ningún otro Pokémon vale!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Rouuuge!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10052006F0075007500750067006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres librar el duelo final entre Armarouge\ny Ceruledge?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00510075006900650072006500730020006C0069006200720061007200200065006C0020006400750065006C006F002000660069006E0061006C00200065006E007400720065002000410072006D00610072006F007500670065000A007900200043006500720075006C0065006400670065003F00100002011401CA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡En guardia!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006E0020006700750061007200640069006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aún no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100FA006E0020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Dónde está el contraste si usamos el mismo?\n¡Tiene que ser Armarouge contra Ceruledge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Haces bien en ser prudente. Esperaré a que estés\nlist<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa para el duelo final.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por fin ha llegado el día de poner a prueba la\nfuerza de Armarouge contra Ceruledge.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Es el duelo final con el que llevo soñando toda\nla vida! Pongámonos en el papel...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 176
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Jamás imaginé que nos reencontraríamos en\nestas circunstancias.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0061006D00E1007300200069006D006100670069006E00E900200071007500650020006E006F00730020007200650065006E0063006F006E007400720061007200ED0061006D006F007300200065006E000A00650073007400610073002000630069007200630075006E007300740061006E0063006900610073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hm. Veo que decidiste hacer que tu Charcadet\nevolucionara a Armarouge.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006D002E002000560065006F0020007100750065002000640065006300690064006900730074006500200068006100630065007200200071007500650020007400750020004300680061007200630061006400650074000A00650076006F006C007500630069006F006E00610072006100200061002000410072006D00610072006F007500670065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Recuerdas nuestro primer duelo, el que libramos\ncuando aún eran Charcadet?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Recuerdo que te gané",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006500630075006500720064006F0020007100750065002000740065002000670061006E00E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Recuerdo que ganaste",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006500630075006500720064006F0020007100750065002000670061006E00610073007400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tal vez... pero ya no soy el que era.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540061006C002000760065007A002E002E002E0020007000650072006F0020007900610020006E006F00200073006F007900200065006C00200071007500650020006500720061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tal vez... pero estoy seguro de que has mejorado\ndesde entonces.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540061006C002000760065007A002E002E002E0020007000650072006F0020006500730074006F0079002000730065006700750072006F002000640065002000710075006500200068006100730020006D0065006A006F007200610064006F000A0064006500730064006500200065006E0074006F006E006300650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Este será el duelo definitivo... que culminará con\nla victoria de mi Ceruledge.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Adelante, Ceruledge. ¡Blande el poder de la llama\nazul!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100640065006C0061006E00740065002C00200043006500720075006C0065006400670065002E002000A10042006C0061006E0064006500200065006C00200070006F0064006500720020006400650020006C00610020006C006C0061006D0061000A0061007A0075006C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Es un duelo entre tu Armarouge y mi\nCeruledge! ¡Ningún otro Pokémon vale!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 7024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿2",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 7184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00320000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La llama azul se apaga... ¡Solo mi etern<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa rival\nhabría podido derrotar a mi Ceruledge!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 7196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La llama azul arde más viva que nunca.\nMi Ceruledge ha resultado vencedor.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 7392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Gracias, ha sido estupendo!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡El duelo con el que siempre había soñado, como\nsi realmente fuéramos rivales predestinados!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǊ",
